- Use `manage_cinemachine` (actions: `create_virtual_camera`, `set_target`, `configure_body`, `configure_aim`, `set_noise`, `get_info`, `list`, `set_priority`, `configure_lens`, `setup_brain`) for Cinemachine virtual cameras.
- Cinemachine requires the Cinemachine package — the tool will prompt for installation if missing.

### Terrain Operations
